{"title": "ASEAN to Discuss Transboundary Haze Ahead of Summit", "summary": "The Association of Southeast Asian Nations (ASEAN) is set to discuss tackling transboundary haze pollution in the lead-up to its November summit. Malaysia has indicated that this issue will be on the agenda.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "आसियान शिखर सम्मेलन से पहले सीमा पार धुंध से निपटने पर करेगा चर्चा", "summary_hi": "दक्षिण पूर्व एशियाई राष्ट्रों का संगठन (आसियान) अपने नवंबर शिखर सम्मेलन से पहले सीमा पार धुंध प्रदूषण से निपटने पर चर्चा करने के लिए तैयार है। मलेशिया ने संकेत दिया है कि यह मुद्दा एजेंडे में रहेगा।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"center": ["Reported that ASEAN will discuss tackling transboundary haze ahead of the November summit, with Malaysia stating the issue will be discussed."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["रिपोर्ट किया कि आसियान नवंबर शिखर सम्मेलन से पहले सीमा पार धुंध से निपटने पर चर्चा करेगा, मलेशिया ने कहा कि इस मुद्दे पर चर्चा की जाएगी।"]}, "topic": "Environment", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "ASEAN to discuss tackling transboundary haze ahead of summit, Malaysia says"}, {"source": "Reuters", "owner": "Reuters", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPaVh1WEt6SjdtOVJUT1dBNGtYTktXMnNqN1NNSkVxNjZxMVZzWU9iNC1vcmxrbXZyQmc2RU9waklzeDBMUHBVZGlJd0RMby10MlYtM3hpemg0bnRkWmFLNks3Z0Jnby1xYjROR1Q4RWp4U05VaGt2V2wzdWRELXJsOXhHeERmWmpPY3VwcHdMelA1R3dndTdTcExsdW96VmdQZDZVNmN4VXhIWENORHBwQlVNU2tWc0xpaWxkcWJ5LUktdnc?oc=5", "headline": "ASEAN to discuss tackling transboundary haze ahead of November summit"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "ASEAN foreign ministers to tackle transboundary haze in November meetings"}, {"source": "Reuters", "owner": "Re